<title>UK: Low &amp; Bonar drops as H1 profits disappoint.</title>
<headline>Low &amp; Bonar drops as H1 profits disappoint.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in plastics and packaging group Low &amp; Bonar Plc tumbled on Monday after reporting half-year, pre-tax profits below analysts expectations, dealers said.</p>
<p>Low &amp; Bonar shares fell 25p to 256-1/2p by 0735 GMT but no trade had been recorded in the stock.</p>
</text>
